<task id="020" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>ProseMirror step→operation interceptor (FR-03) — the core client bridge</title>
    <phase>2 Frontend capture</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Client bridge core: modifies/creates `.ts` in the editor write path (tags include frontend); this is the load-bearing capture piece the whole operational save model depends on. FULL per root §8.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>The core client bridge piece — maps transaction steps to ID-anchored operations; a subtle position/offset mistake corrupts every downstream patch. High-blast-radius, needs the strongest model.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
